  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire et nutritionnelle d&#x2019;urgence et appui au m&#xe9;canisme commun de plaintes et de retours (CFM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of this $2.9m WFP project is to provide food and nutritional assistance to cyclone-affected people. To that end, WFP will transfer over $1.8m in cash to people to cover their food needs and treat children suffering from malnutrition. WFP will also set up a joint complaints and feedback mechanism for the response. In total, WFP will reach 165,108 people through the food assistance component and 7,956 children through the nutrition component.</narrative>
  </description>
